{
  "title": "Achilles Tendonitis",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/foot-and-ankle/7022/achilles-tendonitis",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Mar 15 2026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Achilles Tendonitis consists of a series of 3 conditions affecting the achilles tendon which include: insertional Achilles tendonitis, retrocalcaneal bursitis & Haglund deformity, and Achilles tendonitis.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis can be made with radiographs showing spurs and intratendinous calcification and in the case of Haglund deformity, an enlargement of the posterosuperior tuberosity of the calcaneus.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is a trial of nonoperative management of NSAIDs, activity modification, shoe wear modifications, and physical therapy. Surgical management is indicated in patients with progressive symptoms who fail conservative management.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Insertional Achilles tendonitis",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pain and tendon thickening at insertion of Achilles tendon",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Epidemiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "demographics",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "occurs in middle-aged and elderly patients with a tight heel cord",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mechanism",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "repetitive trauma leads to inflammation followed by cartilagenous then bony metaplasia",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Presentation",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "symptoms",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**posterior heel pain**, swelling, burning, and stiffness",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "shoe wear pain due to direct pressure",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**progressive bony enlargement** of calcaneus at insertion site",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "physical exam",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "inspection",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "midline **tenderness at insertion** site of Achilles tendon",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imaging",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "radiographs",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "lateral foot shows bone spur and intratendinous calcification",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "MRI and ultrasound",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "can demonstrate amount of degeneration",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Studies",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "histology",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "disorganized collagen with **mucoid degeneration**, although few inflammatory cells",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "nonoperative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "activity modification, shoe wear modification, therapy",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "first line of treatment",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "techniques",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "therapy",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "physical therapy with eccentric training",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": []
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "gastrocnemius-soleus stretching",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "2",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "shoe wear",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "**heel sleeves and pads** (mainstay of nonoperative treatment)",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": []
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "**small heel lift**",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": []
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "locked ankle AFO for 6-9 months (if other nonoperative modalities fail)",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "2",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "injections",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "**avoid steroid injections due to risk of Achilles tendon rupture**",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "operative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "retrocalcaneal bursa excision, debridement of diseased tendon, calcaneal bony prominence resection",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "failure of nonoperative management and < 50% of Achilles needs to be removed",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "technique",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "midline, lateral, or medial J-shaped incisions",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "tendon augmentation or transfer (FDL, FHL, or PB) vs. suture anchor repair",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "when > 50% of Achilles tendon insertion must be removed during thorough debridement",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "4",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "heavier patients with more severe disease",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "4",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "FHL transfer has been associated with increased ankle plantar flexion",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Retrocalcaneal bursitis & Haglund deformity",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Definitions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**Retrocalcaneal bursitis**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "is inflammation of the bursa between the anterior aspect of the Achilles and posterior aspect of the calcaneus",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**Haglund deformity**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "an enlargement of the posterosuperior tuberosity of the calcaneus",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epidemiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "demographics",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "more common in **young patients**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Physical exam",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "pain localized to anterior and **2 to 3 cm proximal to the Achilles tendon insertion**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "fullness and tenderness medial and lateral to tendon",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "pain with dorsiflexion",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "bony prominence at Achilles insertion",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imaging",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "radiographs",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "lateral of foot demonstrates Haglund deformity",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "MRI",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "rarely needed",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "nonoperative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "activity modification, shoe wear modification, therapy, NSAIDs",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "first line of treatment",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "techniques",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "therapy",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "ice",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "2",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "shoewear",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "external padding of Achilles tendon",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "2",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "injections",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "**avoid steroid injections due to risk of Achilles tendon rupture**",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "operative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "retrocalcaneal bursa excision, Achilles debridement and resection of Haglund deformity",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "disease refractory to nonoperative management",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "technique",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "midline, lateral, or medial J-shaped incisions",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Achilles Tendonopathy",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Mechanism",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "overuse",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "imbalance of dorsiflexors and plantar flexors",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "poor tendon blood supply",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "genetic predisposition",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "fluoroquinolone antibiotics",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "inflammatory arthropathy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "theorized to be due to **abnormal vascularity** 2 to 6 cm proximal to Achilles insertion in response to repetitive microscopic tearing of the tendon",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Classification",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**Achilles tendinosis**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "tendon thickening",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "thought to be caused by anaerobic degeneration in portion of tendon with poor blood supply",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**Achilles peritendonitis**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "involves inflammation of tendon sheath",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "inflammation of paratenon",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Presentation",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "symptoms",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "pain, swelling, warmth",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "worse symptoms with activity",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "difficulty running",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "physical exam",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "tendon thickening and tenderness 2 to 6 cm proximal to Achilles insertion",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "pain throughout entire range of motion",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imaging",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "MRI",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**disorganized tissue** will show up as intrasubstance intermediate signal intensity",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "thickened tendon",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "chronic rupture will show a hypoechoic region between tendon ends",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "nonoperative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "activity modification, shoe wear modification, therapy, NSAIDs, PRP injections",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "first line of treatment",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "techniques",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "therapy",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "heel lifts",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "cast or removable boot (severe disease)",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "outcomes",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "nonoperative management is 65% to 90% successful",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "glyceryl trinitrate patches, prolotherapy, and aprotinin injections",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "evolving indications due to lack of evidence at this time",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "operative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "percutaneous tenotomies",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "mild to moderate disease",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "techniques",
                      "table": null,
